,{"categorie":"V","fr":"raconter, expliquer"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你讲得很清楚。","pinyin":"Nǐ jiǎng de hěn qīngchu.","fr":"Tu expliques très clairement.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 講 et le glose « réconcilier » : la parole, 言, et 冓 pour le son. Réconcilier, c'est parler et expliquer : le sens moderne en vient. La forme simplifiée remplace 冓 par 井, lu jǐng, qui ne donne pas le son de jiǎng.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 講 and glosses it as “to reconcile”: speech, 言, and 冓 for the sound. Reconciling means talking and explaining: the modern meaning comes from there. The simplified form replaces 冓 with 井, read jǐng, which does not give the sound of jiǎng.","roles":{"讠":"sens","井":"forme"}}},"匠":{"c":"匠","pinyin":"jiàng","lectures":["jiàng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["匚","斤"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0216","L7-2934"],"chemin":{"hsk":1084,"lire":1077},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"artisan","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"artisan, ouvrier"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"酱":{"c":"酱","pinyin":"jiàng","lectures":["jiàng"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["丬","夕","酉"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0356","L6-0432","L6-0433"],"chemin":{"hsk":808,"lire":801},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"sauce, pâte fermentée ; purée","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"sauce, pâte fermentée : soja, haricots"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"purée, confiture"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"面条里放点儿酱更好吃。","pinyin":"Miàntiáo li fàng diǎnr jiàng gèng hǎochī.","fr":"Les nouilles sont meilleures avec un peu de sauce.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"降":{"c":"降","pinyin":"jiàng","lectures":["jiàng","xiáng"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["阝","夂","㐄"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0390","L4-0391","L4-0392","L4-0393","L4-0394","L4-0786","L7-2037","L7-4162"],"chemin":{"hsk":524,"lire":517},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"bai