i wánr.","fr":"Ce week-end, nous allons nous promener à la campagne.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"骄":{"c":"骄","pinyin":"jiāo","lectures":["jiāo"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["马","夭","丨","丨"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L6-0434"],"chemin":{"hsk":809,"lire":802},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"fier, orgueilleux","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"fier, orgueilleux"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"搅":{"c":"搅","pinyin":"jiǎo","lectures":["jiǎo"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","𭕄","见"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-0682","L7-2069","L7-2070"],"chemin":{"hsk":1089,"lire":1082},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"remuer, mélanger ; déranger","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"remuer, mélanger"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"déranger, troubler"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"把咖啡搅一搅再喝。","pinyin":"Bǎ kāfēi jiǎo yī jiǎo zài hē.","fr":"Remue ton café avant de le boire.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"狡":{"c":"狡","pinyin":"jiǎo","lectures":["jiǎo"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["犭","六","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2066"],"chemin":{"hsk":1087,"lire":1080},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"rusé, fourbe","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"rusé, fourbe"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他说的都是狡辩。","pinyin":"Tā shuō de dōu shì jiǎobiàn.","fr":"Tout ce qu'il dit n'est que faux-fuyants.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"矫":{"c":"矫","pinyin":"jiǎo","lectures":["jiǎo","jiáo"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["矢","夭","丨","丨"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-2068"],"chemin":{"hsk":1088,"lire":1081},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"corriger, redresser ; feindre","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"corriger, redresser"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"feindre, simuler"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"她说话有点儿矫情。","pinyin":"Tā shuōhuà yǒudiǎnr jiáoqing.","fr":"Elle parle de façon un peu maniérée.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"绞":{"c":"绞","pinyin":"jiǎo","lectures":["jiǎo"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["纟","六","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2067"],"chemin":{"hsk":1088,"lire":1081},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"tordre, essorer ; hacher","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"tordre, essorer, entortiller"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"hacher, broyer ; pendre"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"她把湿毛巾绞干了。","pinyin":"Tā bǎ shī máojīn jiǎo gān le.","fr":"Elle a essoré la serviette mouillée.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"缴":{"c":"缴","pinyin":"jiǎo","lectures":["jiǎo","zhuó"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["纟","白","方","𠂉","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-2071","L7-2072","L7-2073"],"chemin":{"hsk":1089,"lire":1082},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"payer, remettre ; désarmer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"payer, remettre (ce qui est dû)"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"confisquer, saisir (des armes)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他们缴了敌人的枪。","pinyin":"Tāmen jiǎo le dírén de qiāng.","fr":"Ils ont désarmé l'ennemi.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"脚":{"c":"脚","pinyin":"jiǎo","lectures":["jiǎo","jué"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["月","去","卩"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0276","L5-0396","L6-0436","L7-3770","L7-5377"],"chemin":{"hsk":251,"lire":256},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"pied","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"pied"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"bas, pied : d'une montagne, d'un mur"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我的脚很疼。","pinyin":"Wǒ de jiǎo hěn téng.","fr":"J'ai très mal au pied.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 腳 et le glose « jambe » : la chair, 月, et 卻 pour le son. Le mot a glissé de la jambe au pied. À droite, 却, écrit 去 et 卩, se lit què et ne donne plus le son de jiǎo.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 腳 and glosses it as “shin”: flesh, 月, and 卻 for the sound. The word slid from the leg down to the foot. On the right, 却, written 去 and 卩, is read què and no longer gives the sound of jiǎo.","roles":{"月":"sens","去":"forme","卩":"forme"}}},"角":{"c":"角","pinyin":"jiǎo","lectures":["jiǎo","jué"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L2-0273","L2-0274","L4-0430","L6-1095","L7-2065","L7-2307","L7-2550","L7-3512","L7-3745"],"chemin":{"hsk":225,"lire":234},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"angle, coin ; corne ; jiao","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"angle, coin ; corne"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"jiao : dixième de yuan"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这个三块五角。","pinyin":"Zhège sān kuài wǔ jiǎo.","fr":"Ça fait trois yuans cinquante.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Sur les os oraculaires, 角 dessine une corne de bête, avec ses stries. Le Shuowen jiezi le glose simplement « corne d'animal ». La pointe de la corne a donné « l'angle, le coin », et 角 est aussi un dixième de yuan.","en":"On oracle bones, 角 draws an animal horn with its ridges. The Shuowen jiezi simply glosses it as “animal horn”. The tip of the horn gave “angle, corner”, and 角 is also a tenth of a yuan.","roles":{}}},"饺":{"c":"饺","pinyin":"jiǎo","lectures":["jiǎo"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["饣","六","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0275"],"chemin":{"hsk":250,"lire":256},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ravioli","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"ravioli chinois"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"mnemotechnique","fr":"Pour s'en souvenir : à gauche, 饣, la nourriture. À droite, 交, écrit 六 sur 乂, qui se lit jiāo, la même syllabe que 饺, jiǎo. Une nourriture au son de 交 : le ravioli, 饺子.","en":"As a memory aid: on the left, 饣, food. On the right, 交, written 六 over 乂, which is read jiāo, the same syllable as 饺, jiǎo. A food with the sound of 交: the dumpling, 饺子.","roles":{"饣":"sens","六":"son","乂":"son"}}},"叫":{"c":"叫","pinyin":"jiào","lectures":["jiào"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","丩"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0176","L2-0277","L3-0355","L7-2074","L7-2075"],"chemin":{"hsk":205,"lire":170},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"appeler, s'appeler, crier","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你叫什么名字？","pinyin":"Nǐ jiào shénme míngzi?","fr":"Comment tu t'appelles ?","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"妈妈叫你。","pinyin":"Māma jiào nǐ.","fr":"Maman te demande.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi range 叫 parmi les idéo-phonétiques et le glose par « crier ». 口, la bouche, en donne le sens, et 丩 en donnait le son ; il se lit aujourd'hui jiū, qui ne sonne plus comme jiào. Du cri, on est passé à l'appel : on appelle quelqu'un, et l'on s'appelle d'un nom.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi classes 叫 as a phonetic compound and glosses it as “to shout”. 口, the mouth, gives the meaning, and 丩 once gave the sound; it now reads jiū, which no longer sounds like jiào. From shouting came calling: you call someone, and you are called by a name.","roles":{"口":"sens","丩":"forme"}}},"教":{"c":"教","pinyin":"jiào","lectures":["jiào","jiāo"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["耂","子","攵"],"sources":["surcharge"]},"mots":["L1-0175","L1-0177","L2-0278","L2-0279","L2-0280","L2-0281","L3-0357","L3-0358","L3-0567","L4-0397","L4-0398","L6-0208","L6-0282","L6-0408","L6-0438","L6-0439","L6-1117","L7-0633","L7-1466","L7-1938","L7-2079","L7-2080","L7-2081","L7-4082","L7-4871","L7-5373"],"chemin":{"hsk":115,"lire":200},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"enseigner, apprendre à","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"enseigner, apprendre à quelqu'un","pinyin":"jiāo"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他教我们汉语。","pinyin":"Tā jiāo wǒmen Hànyǔ.","fr":"Il nous enseigne le chinois.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"你能教我做饭吗？","pinyin":"Nǐ néng jiāo wǒ zuòfàn ma?","fr":"Tu peux m'apprendre à cuisiner ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi définit 教 comme « ce que les anciens donnent et que les jeunes imitent » : 攴, la main qui tient une baguette, et 孝. On lit toujours 孝, écrit 耂 sur 子, et 攵 à droite. L'enfant, le maître et sa baguette : c'est enseigner.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi defines 教 as “what elders give and the young imitate”: 攴, a hand holding a rod, and 孝. You still read 孝, written 耂 over 子, and 攵 on the right. The child, the teacher and his rod: that is teaching.","roles":{"耂":"sens","子":"sens","攵":"sens"}}},"轿":{"c":"轿","pinyin":"jiào","lectures":["jiào"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["车","夭","丨","丨"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L7-2076"],"chemin":{"hsk":1090,"lire":1083},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"palanquin, chaise à porteurs","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"palanquin, chaise à porteurs"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"古时候新娘坐花轿出嫁。","pinyin":"Gǔ shíhou xīnniáng zuò huājiào chūjià.","fr":"Autrefois, la mariée partait en palanquin décoré.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"较":{"c":"较","pinyin":"jiào","lectures":["jiào"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["车","六","乂"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0037","L3-0356","L7-1906","L7-2077","L7-2078"],"chemin":{"hsk":390,"lire":386},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"relativement, plutôt ; comparer","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"relativement, plutôt"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"comparer : langue écrite"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这里的东西较贵。","pinyin":"Zhèli de dōngxi jiào guì.","fr":"Ici, les choses sont plutôt chères.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"酵":{"c":"酵","pinyin":"jiào","lectures":["jiào"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["酉","耂","子"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1021"],"chemin":{"hsk":1090,"lire":1083},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"levain, ferment","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"levain, ferment"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"接":{"c":"接","pinyin":"jiē","lectures":["jiē"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","立","女"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0282","L2-0283","L2-0284","L2-0285","L2-0286","L2-0729","L3-0360","L3-0361","L3-0847","L5-0383","L5-0397","L5-0398","L5-0471","L6-0440","L7-2042","L7-2049","L7-2088","L7-2089","L7-2090","L7-2091","L7-2092","L7-2093","L7-2094","L7-2095","L7-2096","L7-2097","L7-2098","L7-2099","L7-2100","L7-2156","L7-4487"],"chemin":{"hsk":251,"lire":257},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"aller chercher ; recevoir ; relier","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"aller chercher, accueillir"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"recevoir, prendre ; répondre au téléphone"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"relier, joindre"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我去机场接你。","pinyin":"Wǒ qù jīchǎng jiē nǐ.","fr":"Je viens te chercher à l'aéroport.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"他不接电话。","pinyin":"Tā bù jiē diànhuà.","fr":"Il ne répond pas au téléphone.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 接 par « joindre » : la main, 扌, et 妾 pour le son. 妾, écrit 立 sur 女, se lit qiè et ne donne plus le son de jiē. La main qui se tend : recevoir, relier, aller au-devant de quelqu'un.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 接 as “to join”: the hand, 扌, and 妾 for the sound. 妾, written 立 over 女, is read qiè and no longer gives the sound of jiē. The hand held out: to receive, to connect, to go and meet someone.","roles":{"扌":"sens","立":"forme","女":"forme"}}},"揭":{"c":"揭","pinyin":"jiē","lectures":["jiē"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["扌","日","勹","人","𠃊"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L6-0441","L7-2101","L7-2102","L7-2103","L7-2104"],"chemin":{"hsk":810,"lire":803},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"soulever, arracher ; dévoiler","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"soulever, arracher : un couvercle, une affiche"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"dévoiler, révéler"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他揭开锅盖看了看。","pinyin":"Tā jiē kāi guōgài kàn le kàn.","fr":"Il a soulevé le couvercle de la marmite pour regarder.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"皆":{"c":"皆","pinyin":"jiē","lectures":["jiē"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["匕","匕","白"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0160","L7-2085"],"chemin":{"hsk":1091,"lire":1084},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"tous, tout","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adv","fr":"tous, tout : langue écrite"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这件事人人皆知。","pinyin":"Zhè jiàn shì rénrén jiē zhī.","fr":"Tout le monde est au courant de cette affaire.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"街":{"c":"街","pinyin":"jiē","lectures":["jiē"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["彳","一","丁","土","土"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L2-0287","L4-0400","L6-0187","L6-0442","L7-0700","L7-2649"],"chemin":{"hsk":252,"lire":257},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"rue","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"rue"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我们去街上走走。","pinyin":"Wǒmen qù jiē shang zǒuzou.","fr":"Allons faire un tour en ville.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 街 par « voie ouverte des quatre côtés » : 行, le carrefour, et 圭 pour le son. 行 s'ouvre de part et d'autre ; au milieu, 圭 s'écrit deux 土 empilés. 圭 se lit guī : il ne donne plus le son de jiē.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 街 as “a road open on four sides”: 行, the crossroads, and 圭 for the sound. 行 opens on either side; in the middle, 圭 is written as two stacked 土. 圭 is read guī: it no longer gives the sound of jiē.","roles":{}}},"阶":{"c":"阶","pinyin":"jiē","lectures":["jiē"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["阝","人","⿰丿丨"],"sources":["cjk-decomp","surcharge"]},"mots":["L4-0399","L4-0694","L7-2082","L7-2083","L7-2084"],"chemin":{"hsk":525,"lire":518},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"marche ; degré, rang","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"marche d'escalier ; degré, rang"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null}}}
